00:01:49.719 --> 00:01:54.080
This means very little, but we'll talk about
what it does do and what it doesn't do. Most

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:58.869
importantly, what it does not do. Signing
this phase one trade deal does not end the

00:01:58.869 --> 00:02:05.060
trade war. Donald Trump has not lowered tariffs
on Chinese goods top line. That's the most

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:10.610
important thing to understand. Everything
else is more or less secondary to that. Really.

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:14.910
This was a photo op for Donald Trump. Here
