imbalance with the United States. Now, I want

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:58.160
to get back to that because we have that trade
imbalance for a reason. Donald Trump objectively

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:04.020
cites it as a, as the, as a deficit by deficit.
I mean he'd sites it as a negative thing.

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:09.060
Um, but our economy is actually based on that
