will now welcome American beef and pork, poultry,
seafood, rice, dairy, infant formula, animal

00:05:19.349 --> 00:05:23.069
feed, biotechnology, and much, much more.

00:05:23.069 --> 00:05:27.889
So you get the idea. Now let me talk a little
bit about the trade imbalance. This is really

00:05:27.889 --> 00:05:33.970
important to understand and uh, I've, I've
mentioned it in passing before. Donald Trump

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:39.479
constantly talks about the trade deficit.
We're importing way more from China than we

